---
// Blink Cursor motif (DESIGN.md #5): a one-off trailing terminal cursor.
// Deliberately not a page-wide gimmick -- use it at most once per page (a
// hero headline's last word, a "last updated" line), never repeated in a
// list or attached to every heading.
---

<span class="blink-cursor" aria-hidden="true">▍</span>

<style>
  .blink-cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--phosphor);
    animation: blink-cursor 1s step-end infinite;
  }
</style>
